{"id": "34057", "title": "爱你！别怪我(上)", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 56, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34057.htm", "intro": "这个男人──好俊朗！她粉颊晕红,水汪汪的大眼含羞带怯地望著他,脑中突兀地浮现一堆赞美词：眉宇清朗、玉树临风、卓尔不群、俊美无俦、风姿飒爽……好像用尽世间所有的形容词,都无法形容他的万分之一好。贝晓风年纪轻轻,却得肩负抚养两个妹妹的重责大任；她虽在精品店上班,却从不相信“麻雀变凤凰”那套故事。天意让她巧合地认识了他──在她偷偷试穿名牌服饰的那天。原以为这假装名门千金的蹩脚谎言很快就会被识破, 但她沦陷的速度是如此之快,每次一回过神, 就发现自己又不知不觉答应他的邀约了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34057", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2165536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2165537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2165538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2165539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2165540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2165541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2165542.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2165543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2165544.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2165545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2165546.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2165547.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2165548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2165549.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2165550.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2165551.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2165552.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2165553.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2165554.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2165555.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2165556.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2165557.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2165558.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2165559.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "